---
import LotusMark from "./LotusMark.astro";
---

<dialog class="story-dialog" id="story-dialog" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="dialog-inner">
    <button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close the story" data-close-story>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M5 5 19 19M19 5 5 19" />
      </svg>
    </button>
    <div class="dialog-ornament" aria-hidden="true">
      <span></span><LotusMark /><span></span>
    </div>
    <h2 id="story-title">The story behind this offering</h2>

    <section class="story-section">
      <h3>A personal offering</h3>
      <p>
        I’m Nikhil. This collection is my way of spending Ganesh Chaturthi in
        prayer, imagination, and art. Each image is an invitation to see Ganesha
        through a different lens—with devotion, curiosity, and joy.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-section">
      <h3>With gratitude</h3>
      <p>
        I’m grateful to the artists, illustrators, animators, storytellers, and
        creators whose work opened these worlds to me. Thank you to OpenAI for
        the creative tools that helped me explore these ideas, and to everyone
        who takes time to look.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-section">
      <h3>An independent project</h3>
      <p>
        Some works are inspired by recognizable characters and storyworlds.
        They are personal, unofficial AI-assisted interpretations—not
        sponsored by, affiliated with, or endorsed by the original creators or
        rights holders. Gratitude recognizes inspiration; it does not imply
        participation or endorsement.
      </p>
    </section>

    <button class="button button-outline dialog-return" type="button" data-close-story>
      Return to the galleries
    </button>
  </div>
</dialog>
